3.0,Graph API,2018-05-01,Changes,Facebook Login,"
- [Access Token Expiration](https://developers.facebook.com/blog/post/2018/05/01/facebook-login-updates-further-protect-privacy/): An access tokens is invalid if the user hasn't engaged the app within the last 90 days.

- The following [default fields](https://developers.facebook.com/documentation/development/permissions?locale=en_US#reference-public_profile) have replaced public_profile:

+    `id`
+    `first_name`
+    `last_name`
+    `middle_name`
+    `name`
+    `name_format`
+    `picture`
+    `short_name`  

As a result, the following fields that belonged to public_profile are deprecated:

+ `age_range`
+ `context`
+ `cover`
+ `currency`
+ `devices`
+ `gender`
+ `link`
+ `locale`
+ `timezone`
+ `updated_time`
+ `verified`

- The [`rsvp_event`](https://developers.facebook.com/documentation/development/permissions#reference-rsvp_event) and [`user_managed_groups`](docs/facebook-login/permissions/#reference-user_managed_groups) permissions are deprecated. The [`user_managed_groups`](docs/facebook-login/permissions/#reference-user_managed_groups) permission can still be used for testing purposes but cannot be submitted for [Login Review](https://developers.facebook.com/docs/facebook-login/review).

- Five new permissions have been added:

- [`groups_access_member_info`](https://developers.facebook.com/documentation/development/permissions#reference-groups_access_member_info) – for receiving member-related data on group content.

- [`publish_to_groups`](https://developers.facebook.com/documentation/development/permissions#reference-publish_to_groups) – for posting content into a group on behalf of a user.

- [`user_age_range`](https://developers.facebook.com/documentation/development/permissions#reference-user_age_range) – for accessing a person's age range.

- [`user_gender`]((/documentation/development/permissions#reference-user_gender) – for accessing a person's gender.

- [`user_link`]((/documentation/development/permissions#reference-user_link) – for accessing the Facebook profile URL for another user of the app.

",removal
